		(property "Design Note" "Reverse-polarity PMOS, drain to input, source to load. Was labelled 'DMP3010L-7', which names no orderable part: DS35716 shows the DMP3010L family as TO-252 and DS32239 as PowerDI5060-8, neither of which fits this SOT-23 land. DS31524 Rev 7-3 p.2 rates VGSS at +/-12 V ONLY, so DZ1 is mandatory, not optional"
