		(property "Design Note" "Buy from MOUSER (595-ADS1119IRTER), which sells this reel in single units. DigiKey DOES list RTER (296-ADS1119IRTERTR-ND, EUR 3.03) but only as a full 3000-piece reel, MOQ 3000 and 0 on hand, so it is unbuyable in prototype quantity there. ADS1119IRTET is an approved alternate -- same die, same 16-WQFN 3x3 RTE package, reel quantity only (250 vs 3000) -- and is DigiKey's small-quantity option at EUR 6.29 cut tape (296-53016-1-ND), about 2x the RTER reel unit price. Use RTET only when sourcing from DigiKey"
